  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "Ma-lá-sóng"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><b>&nbsp;作者：崎仔頭赤子</b></p><p><br /></p><p>你tī佗位我leh揣</p><p>追啊追啊jiok啊jiok</p><p>一步堅持koh一步</p><p>Sī-suā揣你ê跤步</p><p><br /></p><p>心臟m̄知走去佗</p><p>靈魂參雲同齊飛</p><p>雙肢跤骨m̄聽話</p><p>油門無擋就摧--落</p><p><br /></p><p>走標親像leh落雨</p><p>青山綠水tâm糊糊</p><p>走標bē輸suh鴉片</p><p>一場一馬（tsi̍t bé）一直喘</p><p>天涯海角tuè leh走</p><p>Lak袋仔箍箍suah leh háu</p><p><br /></p><p>月娘偷bî笑阮gōng大呆</p><p>Hōo伊ê溫純可愛騙m̄知</p><p>日頭看kah愛笑leh流汗</p><p>笑阮悾笑阮烏白kho̍k-kho̍k-tsông</p><p><br /></p><p>你tī佗</p><p>我koh leh揣</p><div><br /></div><div><br /></div><div><br /></div><div><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"><b>作者註：「一馬（tsi̍t bé）」是一場全程ma-lá-sóng比賽（42.195公里）ê意思。</b></span></div><div><br /></div><div><br /></div><div><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"><b>做伙來唸詩</b></span><b><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">專欄，</span><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">本文使用教育部推薦漢字kap臺灣閩南語羅馬字拼音方案。</span></b></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"><b>台文通訊BONG報320期，2020年11月出刊。</b></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div><br /></div><div><br /></div><div style=\"background-color: white; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\">歡迎捐款贊助　李江却台語文教基金會　（捐款thang抵稅，匯款了後請通知02-23112199）</span></div><div style=\"background-color: white; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><div><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\">線上捐款(定期定額)&nbsp;<a data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"async\" href=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fppt.cc%2FfF5bhx&amp;h=AT1fIGbvLe-H1RfIAEmaBwSoHSud2mWn8lrfo0xPDXLyCEJ6_oyPKdt-VNpBwe2ie9QCjJZfObjdC0zbQCynJ54D2Wi_b8ZrVcDWstK8-oYv8FmldyEJo_KdoHuWC05sSueoTuSvJ5cr-p_vScPimOGX4wzN4y0tm93TSYPwa_Oy3MkFQCQALsRTZFMOuwZl3PJcYWBoT4jwc6LmmvFHGmEYyMh57UFUGaQo8oSSuqcQD7MKG6wLN7MfjP3hZh1vLhHapsOOcRjYmtcIPyZgahNTgWaTFPQekTNcLnwDRhPn5DUPgyHeN0NWy-eAvWaf1orAzEnaT0bXGSBh6WL5ZAg_4sea_VdaRcccV0V-eEdDhNVVJKe0z-BljR9iJL_jWIDn2Jg-L_StZx71NBmaz7xd3VsLzNHGj2fO28pTvMz9QEOhl9nJrC80TCbPW5QlyDfD0ZK9o_8n3YOoDoX6PLV_4rNk2cvzW43qFquAkjfncrxhxCKH-VY6Kf7T3qxnHFKyq5jaEBd-Gzbx3BOuAS0L2ZAq5p4l1ciYXkt6XOQM7lnaWciPYKDMH73hsYXjsMWMXsK2AWmIxmqDhr3wrIhYsOOwJNPzsMyjmPbI9ddmSRJ_pqcuxGjmrXlJMqFxxpVrD6GXJGkN7wZj5MfSb2YRcg\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" style=\"cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\" target=\"_blank\">https://ppt.cc/fF5bhx</a></span></div></div><div style=\"background-color: white; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><div><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\">線上捐款(單筆)&nbsp;<a data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"async\" data-lynx-uri=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fppt.cc%2Ffcycox&amp;h=AT0H6xWALxkqKTZY4xK9Odg526LM77N2q_ltt_Y8nC4_ki5ZoWyAjPPNaKyF6_djXJ_obDEOkx__7WMdaTUsGNOmfg_FDe_nfhDB9cW9M2iyHMHquKL9nqCFMpuMwCF5Gby8kOWjHu6nBgAoYPsZcF2smrFzZVzSNSg15gjibmTXy4sSPf6SrWMQHmUCH9xNvWH_NU1Wp9NzumavCiqfcj4T6os_JW-iktTbi7Rur82KNucjaugBeLf4yIkaMCU_vybvXjKVnWWUq5pAwuVuMCebZdM-rH__LgvZR9zWIlivnX_lBELOjpKo7-lDzasSyJI8UDxgBUsDYSi-TXAqb1moHrcCZPU9DgyiIg0Dl63KER-NQMuehP5AjqLfKITfoVoc9ZXFfr-BItslSWP-mplFEqq82MBwmXwrembzOg-5Qu2qNvQfpLqoI5tvIIN0U_ZNfMHNfcND0dHoyuXmvOdmELx6ODOh4GLkH8uxKdg8hAgwf6LsFQVFWT-8hoopqCulWayrSYRFDyon9I6G-w1eBkO9iWtohOpq8XEA05uL2v6-oh4pTr5QYdobVfeqArrNaSvWLrvE4cL1ci5n7zIes4NNv3dRAAgdx4wRiKX-0e6xJla9fe2ZTCOTyQsZEuUGrdmWYe2l7e4iCwc\" href=\"https://ppt.cc/fcycox\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" style=\"cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\" target=\"_blank\">https://ppt.cc/fcycox</a></span></div></div><div style=\"background-color: white; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><br /></div><div style=\"background-color: white; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><div><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\">郵政劃撥：19021486</span></div><div><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</span></div><div><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\">電匯：123-20-050514-2</span></div><div><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\">華南銀行士林分行活儲</span></div><div><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</span></div><div style=\"font-size: 15px;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot;;\"><span style=\"color: #999999; font-size: x-small;\">李江却台語文教基金會需要你ê定期捐款，逐個月捐助NT$200以上，lán做伙來推動復振台灣語文ê事工，歡迎利用劃撥、電匯、信用卡、郵局『存簿儲金自動轉帳』扣款iah是線頂捐款、現金贊助。</span></div><div style=\"font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot;;\"><span style=\"color: #999999; font-size: x-small;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot;;\"><span style=\"color: #999999; font-size: x-small;\">◎逐個月贊助本會（台文通訊BONG報發行單位）NT$200（iah是逐冬NT$2,400）以上，</span><span style=\"color: #999999; font-size: x-small;\">做伙支持基金會事工kap雜誌編印發行費用。歡迎利用郵局劃撥、信用卡（寫捐款單）、線頂捐款、現金贊助、銀行/ATM轉帳（轉帳了後請通知）、支票、郵局戶頭自動轉帳扣繳（寫授權書），捐款收據ē-tàng做『列舉扣除額』抵稅ê用途。</span></div><div><span style=\"color: #999999; font-size: x-small;\"><br /></span></div></div></div>"
